        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Sion chingdai katuan thu,",
            "Theimei makpui bam khou 4@&;",
            "Rihpi daimei Jisu rui kau the chu latho,",
            "Rih adou khang rihmei nun,",
            "Nangniu rih puan piu thao tho;",
            "Thao tho rihmei guai thao tho,",
            "Kao the Khrista rui.",
            "",
            "2. Pou Raguang chuangphei 4@& jaona,",
            "Tiangka khuan 4@& phai kamma;",
            "Hu thu gut ro rihmei nun,",
            "Buibang sin tipma,",
            "Jisu lat 4@& ning chui lo;",
            "Pou Raguang chuangphei jaolo,",
            "Raguang rui hu gut puni,",
            "Rih4@& adou khang.",
            "",
            "3. Kandih mei riak phungmei nun,",
            "Raguang lat khou meijak mei;",
            "Seitan rihta pingmei nun,",
            "Athei lai rio,",
            "Kapui kapu lou duna;",
            "Thei khang man khang pingmak mei,",
            "Kathei kari dat mak mei,",
            "Nun rui lai kandiu.",
            "",
            "4. Guang o mei nuan phungmei nun,",
            "Tingkau kandih lakhang 4@&;",
            "Tingsang ritho guang khap tho,",
            "Jisu thei laina,",
            "Theimei ta ngam lou duna;",
            "Tarou khou rui thao datna,",
            "Katik kagun 4@& daina,",
            "Tingkau kukan the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
